# S000520 candidate summary

Added the path-preserving Rust translation for
`arch/x86/include/asm/emulate_prefix.h` at
`src/arch/x86/include/asm/emulate_prefix.rs`.

The candidate exports one five-byte `u8` sequence for each original escape
prefix, preserving the exact UD2 bytes and the respective Xen/KVM ASCII
signature byte order.  It adds only immutable provenance and explanatory
comments; it introduces no behavior beyond the header's initializer values.
